# Cloudflare Pages headers — the counterpart of netlify.toml, same rules in this host's syntax.
# Pages' own defaults already send HTML with `public, max-age=0, must-revalidate`, so only the
# immutable case has to be stated. If both files ever disagree, netlify.toml is the one that
# describes the live site today; keep them in step when either changes.

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
